# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Access Control Policy
**Document ID**: SEC-006
**Classification**: Internal
**Version**: 3.2
**Last Updated**: January 2025

---

## Purpose

This policy establishes requirements for controlling access to MedSync Health information systems and data to protect confidentiality, integrity, and availability.

---

## Scope

This policy applies to:
- All MedSync employees, contractors, and vendors
- All information systems and applications
- All data, including PHI, PII, and corporate data
- Physical access to facilities

---

## Access Control Principles

### Core Principles

| Principle | Description |
|-----------|-------------|
| Least Privilege | Users receive minimum access needed for role |
| Need-to-Know | Access limited to job requirements |
| Separation of Duties | Critical functions divided among personnel |
| Defense in Depth | Multiple layers of access control |
| Default Deny | Access denied unless explicitly granted |

