## Identity Management

### Account Types

| Account Type | Description | Approval |
|--------------|-------------|----------|
| Employee | Standard user account | Manager + IT |
| Contractor | Time-limited account | Manager + IT + Security |
| Service Account | Application/system use | Security + Engineering |
| Privileged | Admin access | Security + Director |
| Break-Glass | Emergency access | CISO pre-approved |

### Account Lifecycle

| Phase | Process | SLA |
|-------|---------|-----|
| Provisioning | Hire/onboard ticket | 24 hours |
| Modification | Access change request | 24-48 hours |
| Termination | Immediate disable | Same-day |
| Deprovisioning | Full removal | 7 days |
| Review | Quarterly certification | Per schedule |

### Account Standards

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Username Format | firstname.lastname@medsync.health |
| Account Creation | Automated via Okta |
| Default Access | Basic employee (email, Slack) |
| Additional Access | Request via ServiceNow |
