## Authentication Requirements

### Multi-Factor Authentication

| System Category | MFA Required | Exceptions |
|-----------------|--------------|------------|
| All Production Systems | Yes | None |
| Corporate Applications | Yes | None |
| VPN | Yes | None |
| Email | Yes | None |
| Development Systems | Yes | Local dev only |

### MFA Methods

| Method | Approved | Primary Use |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| Okta Verify (Push) | Yes | Primary |
| Hardware Key (YubiKey) | Yes | High security |
| TOTP | Yes | Backup |
| SMS | No | Phased out |
| Email OTP | No | Not permitted |

### Password Requirements

| Requirement | Standard |
|-------------|----------|
| Minimum Length | 14 characters |
| Complexity | 3 of 4 character types |
| History | 12 passwords |
| Maximum Age | 90 days |
| Lockout | 5 failed attempts |
| Lockout Duration | 30 minutes |

### Passwordless Authentication

| Method | Status | Use Case |
|--------|--------|----------|
| FIDO2/WebAuthn | Approved | SSO, high-security |
| Certificate-based | Approved | Service accounts |
| Biometric | Approved | Device unlock |

