## Privileged Access Management

### Privileged Account Categories

| Category | Examples | Controls |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Root/Admin | AWS root, domain admin | Break-glass only |
| Service Admin | DB admin, app admin | PAM, just-in-time |
| Security Admin | SIEM admin, EDR admin | Segregated, monitored |
| Developer Elevated | Production deploy | Time-limited, logged |

### PAM Controls

| Control | Implementation |
|---------|----------------|
| Vault | CyberArk Privilege Cloud |
| Just-in-Time Access | 4-hour maximum sessions |
| Session Recording | All privileged sessions |
| Password Rotation | Automatic, daily for shared |
| Approval Workflow | Dual approval for critical |

### Break-Glass Procedures

| Step | Action |
|------|--------|
| 1 | Emergency declared |
| 2 | Break-glass account requested |
| 3 | CISO/delegate approval |
| 4 | Time-limited access granted |
| 5 | Session recorded and audited |
| 6 | Post-use review |

